{"step_index":1107,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-10T14:22:04Z","thinking":"**Reviewing the Nginx configuration.**\n\nExamining the current configuration file reveals the server details.  Focusing on the configuration, to determine the necessary updates.  The analysis will guide the configuration modification process to ensure correct settings.\n\n\n**Analyzing the Nginx configuration.**\n\nThe configuration uses Let's Encrypt certificates for SSL and redirects root requests to a specific application path. A reverse proxy forwards traffic to a backend server over HTTPS on port 9443. Proxy headers are set for correct forwarding.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"/home/koby/.ansible/kssh th2-revproxyp-fe1 'cat << \\\"EOF\\\" | sudo tee /etc/nginx/sites-available/03-map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf\\n# HTTPS Centreon MAP\\nserver {\\n    listen              172.30.198.33:9443 ssl http2;\\n    listen              109.62.64.18:9443 ssl http2;\\n    server_name         map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr 109.62.64.18;\\n\\n    # SSL (certificat dédié Let'\\\\''s Encrypt)\\n    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/fullchain.pem;\\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/privkey.pem;\\n\\n    # security\\n    include             nginxconfig.io/security.conf;\\n\\n    # logging\\n    access_log          /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-access.log;\\n    error_log           /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-error.log warn;\\n\\n    # Redirection explicite racine -> /centreon-map/\\n    location = / {\\n        return 301 /centreon-map/;\\n    }\\n\\n    # reverse proxy vers Map (Tomcat HTTPS sur port 9443)\\n    location / {\\n        proxy_pass                 https://172.30.198.50:9443;\\n        proxy_ssl_verify           off;\\n\\n        # Protoco