{"step_index":1108,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-10T14:22:12Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-10T18:22:12+04:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 6237460b-4163-4167-a26e-b8194f657433/task-1108\nTask Description: /home/koby/.ansible/kssh th2-revproxyp-fe1 'cat << \"EOF\" | sudo tee /etc/nginx/sites-available/03-map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr.conf\n# HTTPS Centreon MAP\nserver {\n    listen              172.30.198.33:9443 ssl http2;\n    listen              109.62.64.18:9443 ssl http2;\n    server_name         map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr 109.62.64.18;\n\n    # SSL (certificat dédié Let'\\''s Encrypt)\n    ssl_certificate     /etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/fullchain.pem;\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr/privkey.pem;\n\n    # security\n    include             nginxconfig.io/security.conf;\n\n    # logging\n    access_log          /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-access.log;\n    error_log           /var/log/nginx/map.extranetclient.outremer-telecom.fr-error.log warn;\n\n    # Redirection explicite racine -> /centreon-map/\n    location = / {\n        return 301 /centreon-map/;\n    }\n\n    # reverse proxy vers Map (Tomcat HTTPS sur port 9443)\n    location / {\n        proxy_pass                 https://172.30.198.50:9443;\n        proxy_ssl_verify           off;\n\n        # Protocol & keepalive\n        proxy_http_version         1.1;\n        proxy_cache_bypass         $http_upgrade;\n        proxy_set_header Upgrade   $http_upgrade;\n        proxy_set_header Connection $connection_upgrade;\n\n        # Proxy headers (single definition per header to comply with RFC 7230)\n        proxy_set_header Host              $http_host;\n        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP         $remote_addr;\n        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For   $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n        proxy_set_header X-Fo